frame-vrc downloads or builds FEX from https://github.com/StonkGuy/FEX (MIT, as FEX-Emu). The tool itself ships no FEX binaries,
no game files and no Easy Anti-Cheat files: EAC comes from Valve's Proton EasyAntiCheat Runtime, installed by Steam.
Prebuilt FEX packages (fex-*-steamframe-aarch64.tar.gz, made by `frame-vrc pack`) contain FEX binaries built from that
source, with FEX's MIT license as LICENSE.FEX.
